        "created_at": "2021-04-13T19:17:15.100Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi. I am building a Divided character (Divided Psyche) with two distinct personalities. Two things have come up.<br>\nA) Would you need to create two Health scores, as they have a different Red Qualities, powers and qualities?<br>\nB) I have chosen the Red Quality upgrade for the Retcon, but would that apply to one or both personalities? I have choose the latter but wasn’t sure if that’s correct.</p>",
