        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/angille/{size}/1917_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-04-14T10:29:21.176Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A) the health section says to use “The maximum value of your Red status die” — I’ve always interpreted that to mean you would use the larger one and that contributes to your health for the whole character.</p>\n<p>B) that’s, uh, hm. I’d do both (not as interesting for Naive or Nurturing, lol). otherwise it’s not applying to the whole character, is it?</p>",
