      {
        "id": 236810,
        "name": "Sonvar",
        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-04-14T12:52:27.260Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Justindoodler\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"28412\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/justindoodler/48/4832_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Justindoodler:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>B) I have chosen the Red Quality upgrade for the Retcon, but would that apply to one or both personalities? I have choose the latter but wasn’t sure if that’s correct.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I assume you are talking about the red status die upgrade as the Retcon doesn’t allow for upgrading die size of powers or qualities.   My view is that the red status die size upgrade would apply to both.   Divided feels fairly limited as an archetype to me and giving that benefit seems appropriate to me.</p>",
