        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/justindoodler/{size}/4832_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-04-14T12:58:08.405Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thanks for that. I think it is easier, as you have done, to think of the character as a whole, even though it’s divided. So one Health rating based on all of the available qualities and powers, and using the best Red status value, so in this case 34 Health. Then switching between forms isn’t a headache!</p>",
